abstract: "Python library for the automated symbolic computation of the basic reproduction number R0 of compartmental ODE models via the next-generation matrix method, with block-by-block disease-free equilibria, verification of the van den Driessche-Watmough assumptions, global sensitivity analysis and numerical simulation."
